      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clewiston%2C_Florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city incorporated in 1925 and grew around the Atlantic Coast Line Railroad that linked it to Florida’s commercial network.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://westpalmbeach.wiki/a/Clewiston",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The local economy has long been driven by sugarcane, with large farms surrounding the lake and the Sugar Headquarters & Factory still a landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
